    "group": "Gauntlet Task Force",
    "summary": "In your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), after your **ADEPTUS ASTARTES TRANSPORT** finishes shooting, you may mark one enemy it hit as **assailed** through turn end. Attacks into that enemy gain **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)** if the attacker is an **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** unit and [disembarked](vsdata:core-rule/disembarking) during the same turn.",
